xt":"I thought there would be plenty of fae living in other places too, like back home. Even Snezhnograd has its fair share of them.","nextNodeIds":[760034005]},{"nodeId":760034005,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21882,"speakerName":"Netochka","textMapHash":1505703106,"text":"But then I ended up in Nod-Krai and haven't even seen a single one of them. Paimon also said she isn't fae. Hmm... It's got nothing to do with the climate here, right...?","nextNodeIds":[760034013]},{"nodeId":760034013,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21882,"speakerName":"Netochka","textMapHash":3047515338,"text":"There's no snowstorms here, and you won't be left without options if you're caught without a stove in the wild.","nextNodeIds":[760034014]},{"nodeId":760034014,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21882,"speakerName":"Netochka","textMapHash":3488797498,"text":"Oh and, I even saw someone drinking liquor from Novokitezhgrad in Nod-Krai. We're known for our liquor industry as much as our mining industry, but still, seeing stuff from home makes me... sentimental?","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":760034011,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2814957722,"text":"See you around!","nextNodeIds":[760034012]},{"nodeId":760034012,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21882,"speakerName":"Netochka","textMapHash":4228710186,"text":"Yeah! Until then, good luck to the both of us!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_GAME_TIME_TICK","PPFLKMOMKAI":"0,24"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":